---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section id="about">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="about-grid">
			<div class="about-left">
				<span class="eyebrow">Our Story</span>
				<h2>We don't build furniture.<br>We build heirlooms.</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="about-right">
				<p class="about-lead">For over twenty years, Knights Wood Works has been turning raw timber into pieces that define spaces and outlast trends.</p>
				<p>Every commission starts with a conversation. We want to know how you live, what you love, and what you need the piece to do — not just today, but in twenty years. That obsession with longevity shapes every decision, from the wood we select to the joinery we use.</p>
				<p>We don't cut corners, and we don't rush. Good wood deserves patience.</p>
				<div class="about-mark">
					<img src={`${base}assets/knight_facing_right.png`} alt="" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	#about {
		background-color: var(--color-cream);
		padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
	}

	.about-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 5fr 6fr;
		gap: var(--spacing-xl);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.about-left {
		position: sticky;
		top: calc(var(--header-height) + var(--spacing-md));
	}

	.about-left h2 {
		font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.75rem);
		line-height: 1.08;
		color: var(--color-ink);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.about-lead {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--color-ink);
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.about-right p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.85;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
	}

	.about-mark {
		margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
		padding-top: var(--spacing-md);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
	}

	.about-mark img {
		height: 52px;
		width: auto;
		opacity: 0.12;
		filter: sepia(1);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: var(--spacing-md);
		}

		.about-left {
			position: static;
		}
	}
</style>
